-*- markdown -*-
% dl, yt

# list format
```shell
yt-dlp --list-formats '<url>'
```

# get beast video and audio
```shell
yt-dlp --embed-thumbnail --add-metadata --format "bestvideo+bestaudio" --merge-output-format mp4 -o "%(title)s.%(ext)s" --paths $HOME/Movies '<url>'
```

# get beast video and audio with cookie
```shell
yt-dlp --embed-thumbnail --add-metadata --format "bestvideo+bestaudio"                           -o "%(title)s.%(ext)s" --paths $HOME/Movies --cookies-from-browser chrome '<url>'
```

# get twicast
```shell
yt-dlp --cookies-from-browser chrome --video-password <pass> -o "%(title)s.%(ext)s" --paths $HOME/Movies '<url>'
```
